{"seq":5,"slug":"adult-continuing-education","title":"成人教育与继续学习","stage":"DONE","category":"education","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"成人教育与继续学习-简介\">成人教育与继续学习 简介</h1><p>成人教育与继续学习是教育体系中服务于成年群体的重要组成部分，它关注成人在不同人生阶段和职业发展中的学习需求，强调自主性、经验性和问题导向的学习方式。在知识快速迭代的时代，终身学习能力已成为个人和组织保持竞争力的关键。</p>\n<p>本手册面向教育工作者、企业培训管理者和关注自我发展的职业人士，系统介绍成人学习的理论基础、职业发展教育的实践方法以及终身学习体系的构建路径。读者将理解成人学习的独特规律，并掌握推动自身和他人持续成长的有效方法。</p>\n<p>全书共分为三章，从理论到实践再到体系构建：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>成人学习理论</strong>系统梳理成人教育学的核心理论，包括诺尔斯的成人教育学原理、自主学习理论的核心主张与实践方法，以及梅齐罗转化学习理论对深层认知变革的解释框架。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>职业发展教育</strong>聚焦工作场景中的学习与成长，探讨工作场所学习的特点与有效模式，介绍能力模型在职业发展路径设计中的应用，并讲解导师制与教练辅导的实施方法。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>终身学习体系</strong>从系统层面审视学习的持续性，介绍国际终身学习框架与政策实践，分析非正式学习与经验学习的价值与认可机制，并探讨学习型社区与学习型组织的建设路径。</p>\n<p>建议读者先理解成人学习的理论基础，再结合职业发展的实际需求探索适合的学习策略，最终建立持续学习与自我更新的长期习惯。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"adult-learning-theory","title":"成人学习理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/adult-learning-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"andragogy","title":"成人教育学原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/adult-learning-theory/andragogy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-directed-learning","title":"自主学习理论与实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/adult-learning-theory/self-directed-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"transformative-learning","title":"转化学习理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/adult-learning-theory/transformative-learning"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"professional-development","title":"职业发展教育","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/professional-development","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"workplace-learning","title":"工作场所学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/professional-development/workplace-learning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"competency-development","title":"能力模型与职业发展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/professional-development/competency-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mentoring-coaching","title":"导师制与教练辅导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/professional-development/mentoring-coaching"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"lifelong-learning","title":"终身学习体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/lifelong-learning","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lifelong-learning-frameworks","title":"终身学习框架与政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/lifelong-learning/lifelong-learning-frameworks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"informal-learning","title":"非正式学习与经验学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/lifelong-learning/informal-learning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"learning-communities","title":"学习型社区与组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/education/adult-continuing-education/lifelong-learning/learning-communities"}]}]}